+       info
+           les cinq fautes que peut comporter un message

-       detail
-           Each case renders as its message:
+       detail
+           Chaque cas se rend sous la forme de son message :

-           ```tabular
+           ```tabular

-           column  Case
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
-           row  `Truncated(offset)`  _the protobuf data ended unexpectedly at offset `offset`_  a length prefix, fixed value or varint ran past the end of its window
-           row  `MalformedVarint(offset)`  _a varint was malformed at offset `offset`_  more than ten continuation bytes
-           row  `UnexpectedWireType(found, offset)`  _an unexpected wire type, `found`, was encountered at offset `offset`_  a tag's wire code was 3, 4 (the deprecated groups), 6 or 7
-           row  `Overflow(offset)`  _a numeric value was too large for its type at offset `offset`_  a tenth varint byte contributing more than bit 63
-           row  `MissingField(number)`  _the required field number `number` was missing_  a `oneof` with no variant present; a decode-level fault, with no offset
+           column  Cas
+           column  Message
+           column  Remarque
+           row  `Truncated(offset)`  _the protobuf data ended unexpectedly at offset `offset`_  un préfixe de longueur, une valeur fixe ou un varint a dépassé la fin de sa fenêtre
+           row  `MalformedVarint(offset)`  _a varint was malformed at offset `offset`_  plus de dix octets de continuation
+           row  `UnexpectedWireType(found, offset)`  _an unexpected wire type, `found`, was encountered at offset `offset`_  le code de transmission d'un tag valait 3, 4 (les groupes obsolètes), 6 ou 7
+           row  `Overflow(offset)`  _a numeric value was too large for its type at offset `offset`_  un dixième octet de varint contribuant au-delà du bit 63
+           row  `MissingField(number)`  _the required field number `number` was missing_  un `oneof` sans variante présente ; une faute au niveau du décodage, sans décalage

-           ```
+           ```

-       entry .communicable   renders each reason as the message above
